+## Routes
+
+All routes are listed under Routes in `README.md`.
+
+`POST /import/sales` accepts `{ "csv": "ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty\n..." }`.
+Quantities are positive whole portions, timestamps are ISO instants, and a ticket
+previously imported is skipped in full. The response counts new tickets and
+dishes (portions). An invalid row or insufficient stock rejects the whole file.
+
+`GET /reports/variance?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD` returns an array of
+`{ itemId, theoretical, actual, difference }` for inclusive UTC days. The
+difference is actual minus theoretical, in the item’s unit; theoretical use is
+snapshotted when sales are imported.
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
